# Docker build context exclusions. The build context is the REPO ROOT
# (docker build -f apps/voice-agent/Dockerfile .), so these patterns are
# root-relative and apply to every path the Dockerfile copies.
#
# This is a denylist of things that must NEVER reach an image, not a
# size optimisation. It is written to hold even when the files don't exist
# today: apps/voice-agent/.env is a documented secrets location in
# .env.example, and `COPY apps/voice-agent apps/voice-agent` runs AFTER
# `pnpm install`, so any future .env would be baked into the image layer and
# any host-built node_modules would overlay the correctly installed ones.

# ── secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.keystore
**/id_rsa*
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc

# ── version control and CI ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github
**/.gitkeep

# ── dependencies: always installed inside the image, never copied ────────
# pnpm's node_modules is a symlink farm containing per-architecture native
# binaries (onnxruntime-node). Copying a macOS/arm64 tree into a linux image
# produces binaries that cannot load.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# ── build artifacts and caches ───────────────────────────────────────────
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo
**/.turbo
audio-cache
**/audio-cache

# ── host/tooling state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vercel
**/.vercel
.fly
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp
**/.DS_Store

# ── not needed by the worker image ───────────────────────────────────────
# apps/web is deployed separately on Vercel, so its SOURCE is excluded — but
# its package.json must stay in the context, because pnpm needs every
# workspace importer present for --frozen-lockfile to validate. A COPY cannot
# resurrect a path that .dockerignore removed from the context, so the
# exception below is required, not cosmetic.
apps/web
!apps/web/package.json

# Same reasoning: `content` is a workspace member, so keep its manifest.
content
!content/package.json

docs
README.md
**/*.md
**/*.test.ts
**/_verify-*.ts
**/_seed-*.ts
